  s01: <
    handle: "custom-boof/01"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "The town counting room was calm the way a drawn bowstring is calm. Sunlight poured through tall stone arches over immaculate cedar shelves, empty clerk stools, and a master ledger spread wide upon the central desk. Bo..."
